{"symbol":"FSG.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:50:29Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Modelarska 11","city":"Katowice","zip":"40-142","country":"Poland","phone":"48 32 735 0000","fax":"48 32 258 2266","website":"https://www.fasing.pl","industry":"Metal Fabrication","industryKey":"metal-fabrication","industryDisp":"Metal Fabrication","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Fabryki Sprzetu i Narzedzi Górniczych Grupa Kapitalowa FASING S.A. produces and sells chains for the mining, fishing, energy, sugar, cement, and wood industries worldwide. It operates through Chain, Small Mechanization Equipment and Forging, and Other segments. The company provides round mining link chains, flat mining link chains, chain assemblies, flight bars, clamps, locks, connecting links, wear resistant round link chains, lifting chains, and chains for hoists. It also offers die forgings and forging tools, clutches, drills, bolting machines, hydraulic units, stands, and others. The company exports its products to China, the United States, Australia, Germany, Sweden, Kazakhstan, and Ukraine. Fabryki Sprzetu i Narzedzi Górniczych Grupa Kapitalowa FASING S.A. was founded in 1925 and is headquartered in Katowice, Poland. Fabryki Sprzetu i Narzedzi Górniczych Grupa Kapitalowa FASING S.A. is a subsidiary of Karbon 2 Sp. z o.o.","fullTimeEmployees":259,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Mateusz  Bik","title":"President & General Director","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Zofia  Guzy","title":"VP of the Management Board & Technical Director","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Stanislaw  Bik","title":"Secretary of the Supervisory Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Stanislaw  Prusek","title":"Vice-President of the Management Board & Development Director","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"pri